00:020:01.000 --> 00:020:05.000
if the doubt comes in my heart, unfortunately, I still have some doubts.

00:020:05.000 --> 00:020:12.000
I'm still in the lowest rank. I'm still on my way. It's not hopeless yet.

00:020:12.000 --> 00:020:21.000
But you must be aware of this principle. This is our principle. If it is not in the Quran, I don't believe it.

00:020:21.000 --> 00:020:26.000
May or may not be correct. But if it is not in the Quran, I'm not following it.

00:020:37.000 --> 00:020:44.000
We have time now to do the Friday prayer and then go into...

00:020:44.000 --> 00:020:51.000
I can't linger any longer until Ismail is here. So, we'll just go prepare for the Friday prayer

00:020:51.000 --> 00:021:00.000
and I'm sure Ismail will get his chance to express his views. He had prepared a very good KHUTBAH on the ink and paper.

00:021:00.000 --> 00:021:05.000
But this... this is... this is not the Quran. The ink and paper, the physical book is not the Quran.

00:021:05.000 --> 00:021:11.000
The Quran is in your heart. When the prophet Muhammad was taken to the seventh heaven to receive the Quran,

00:021:11.000 --> 00:021:14.000
God did not give him a book. Ismail's here?

00:021:14.000 --> 00:021:17.000
A man: No. I waited and I waited.

00:021:17.000 --> 00:021:19.000
The messenger: Oh, he was supposed to come with you.

00:021:19.000 --> 00:021:20.000
A man: Yes.

00:021:27.000 --> 00:021:31.000
The messenger: How about the Washington group?

00:021:50.000 --> 00:021:52.000
And where is Abdulwahid?

00:021:53.000 --> 00:021:57.000
Brother Abdulwahid, is that you? Welcome to the conference.

00:021:58.000 --> 00:022:06.000
So, looks like Ismail... we do believe that he'll be here for his own funeral. And now, it is confirmed.

00:022:06.000 --> 00:022:08.000
AQEM AL-SALAT.

